			<details class="wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow"><summary>What is the difference between recorded and live cohorts?</summary>
				
				<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Recorded courses are self-paced: watch the video lessons any time and rewatch as often as you like. Live cohorts run on a fixed schedule with real-time instructor sessions, Q&amp;A and peer collaboration. Both follow the same curriculum.</p>
				
